    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72654" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀϊστ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shoot arrows,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅν τις ὀϊστεύσας ἔβαλεν</span> whom
			one shot <i>with an arrow,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.196
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.216
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξῳ ὀϊστεύσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.84
				</span></i>
			 : c. gen. objecti, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ ἄγ᾽ ὀΐστευσον Μενελάου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.100
				</span></i>
			 : c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτῖνας
			ὀ.,</span> etc., <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				41.257
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>shoot with an arrow,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.57
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ βελέμνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					15.322
				</span></i>
			.</div>
